                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/3323: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-31T12:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                                1920—12 noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received March 31—7:05
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Your telegram 69, March 26, 2 p.m. News exaggerated, no casualties. Reporting
                    by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
